      451.2,
      344.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 2 of the Revocation of Irrevocable Deeds of Gifton the Ground of Gross Ingratitude Act, No. 5 of 2017 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended is to make provisionto revoke an irrevocable deed of gift on the ground of gross ingratitude, only on an ordermade by a competent court.",
