    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      393.91,
      451.21,
      422.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4: This clause replaces section 4 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to specify a comprehensive procedure for the registration oflis pendens.",
